<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<task id="012" project="spaarkeai-mcp-bff-api-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>Complete the matter-summary Insights topic (column, registry row, persister check)</title>
    <phase>0 Removal, prerequisites and seams</phase>
    <gate>scripts startable; the dev schema change and registry seed need the owner's explicit go</gate>
    <status>in-progress</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Adds a Dataverse column and a configuration row consumed by the live persister; may touch WorkProductRecordPersister (.cs) if the data path does not write it</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Follows the documented matter-health precedent (BUILD-A-NEW-INSIGHT-CARD.md) with a data-driven persister; judgment points are escalation triggers</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>A</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Owns a new schema script, a seed script and notes; touches no file another Phase 0 task edits</parallel-reason>
    <deps>none</deps>
    <tags>dataverse, fields, ai, integration-test</tags>
    <estimated-effort>3-4 hours</estimated-effort>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Complete the matter-summary Insights topic so a summary is cached on the matter: add a target long-text column on sprk_matter, seed the sprk_aitopicregistry row for the existing Binding matter-summary (SUM-CHAT@v1) with sprk_hostentity sprk_matter and sprk_targetfield the new column and a TTL, and prove the persister writes it the way matter-health writes sprk_performancesummary. Dev schema and seed run only after the owner's go.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. Expert in the Insights topic registry, Binding rows and Dataverse schema scripts.</role>
  <goal>A matter-summary run persists its envelope to the new sprk_matter column through WorkProductRecordPersister (no code change expected); the registry row gives the TTL task 032 reads through TopicRegistryTtlLookup; the evidence is recorded.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Spec FR-10 prerequisite; owner 2026-11-25: complete the matter-summary topic, not matter-health. Discovery: Binding row matter-summary (SUM-CHAT@v1) exists (docs/data-model/sprk-playbookconsumer.md; infra/dataverse/inputschemas/sum-chat-v1.input.schema.json) but has no sprk_aitopicregistry row and no target column. WorkProductRecordPersister.cs:40-70: WHETHER a Binding persists is sprk_disposition = work_product on the Binding; WHERE is the registry row whose sprk_topicname equals the Binding's capability code, supplying sprk_hostentity + sprk_targetfield; writes are user-OBO PATCH with If-Match *. matter-health precedent: registry row c46b940e-… (TTL 60 min) → sprk_matter.sprk_performancesummary (BUILD-A-NEW-INSIGHT-CARD.md :56-66).</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="new">scripts/dataverse/Add-MatterSummaryColumn.ps1 (idempotent; long-text column on sprk_matter, name chosen per the skill, for example sprk_aisummary)</file>
      <file role="new">scripts/dataverse/Seed-MatterSummaryTopicRegistry.ps1 (idempotent upsert of the sprk_aitopicregistry row)</file>
      <file role="new">projects/spaarkeai-mcp-bff-api-r2/notes/012-matter-summary-topic.md (metadata read, chosen names, owner go, run evidence)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/WorkProductRecordPersister.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/Insights/TopicRegistryTtlLookup.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/Insights/InsightsPlaybookExecutionCache.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">docs/guides/BUILD-A-NEW-INSIGHT-CARD.md (matter-health rows and registry fields)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">docs/data-model/sprk-playbookconsumer.md</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">scripts/dataverse/Add-AnalysisRegardingRecordUrlColumn.ps1 (existing column-add script shape)</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies/>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">Read first (read-only, Dataverse MCP or Web API): the matter-summary Binding row (sprk_disposition, consumer code/type), the matter-health registry row's fields, and sprk_matter's existing long-text columns; record them in notes/012-matter-summary-topic.md before writing scripts.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">The schema script and the seed script are idempotent and target dev only; they run only after the owner's explicit go in this session (live change). Field security on the new column matches sprk_performancesummary's (copy, do not invent).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-039">The registry row carries target-mapping data only (sprk_topicname = the Binding's capability code, sprk_hostentity sprk_matter, sprk_targetfield the new column, TTL); no appsettings key, code list or new table. If the Binding's sprk_disposition is not work_product, record it and escalate rather than changing the Binding.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-002">No plugin; persistence stays in WorkProductRecordPersister's user-OBO PATCH. If a code change to the persister seems needed, STOP and escalate (it is shared by every work-product topic).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">The matter form, insight card and Console are not changed in this task (task 032 reads the column; showing it on a form is out of scope).</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>.claude/constraints/plugins.md</file>
      <file>.claude/patterns/dataverse/plugin-structure.md</file>
      <file>.claude/skills/dataverse-deploy/SKILL.md</file>
      <file>.claude/skills/dataverse-create-schema/SKILL.md</file>
